  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medication to Treat and Prevent Blindness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Too many people live in areas that have access to little or no eye care. Unfortunately, without access to basic eye care - like the provision of antibiotics to treat eye infections, like trachoma - these people face a lifetime of blindness. And sadly, children are especially at risk of catching this disease. Fortunately, a low-cost antibiotic effectively prevents and treats this disease. With your support, Orbis can distribute this vital medication in Ethiopia, ensuring widespread availability.</narrative>
  </description>
